<https://www.insperity.com/graph/change-log> {

  <https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/2026-10-19T184337Z-primitives> a prov:Activity , dct:ProvenanceStatement ;
    rdfs:label "Primitives backfill, hyphen-joined identifiers and relinking (Baseline Core v1.0), 2026-10-19T18:43:37Z"@en ;
    dct:description "After a term-by-term review with Jeffrey Wallk (design decisions 1-30, review/design-decisions.md): 367 primitives were added to the core vocabularies (review/primitives-added.txt, registry review/primitives-v1.tsv), with seven new vocabularies (decision, governance, job, logic, measure, policy, value); job, journey and outcome moved from the requirements vocabulary to the job vocabulary, and the polymorphic job terms became concepts of the new core job taxonomy. Personas are no longer typed by role (seven engineering persona types and persona role removed); the product marketing lifecycle stages were removed. 912 taxonomy concept IRIs were changed to hyphen-joined words (§3.2 as amended); every one of the 922 concepts now carries dcterms:subject to each primitive it is built from and core:hasPrimaryTerm to its head primitive (review/concept-links.csv). review/crosswalk-v1.csv maps every old IRI to its new one or records its removal. Versions stay 0.1.0 (Draft). Changed outside the KE Workbench; recorded retrospectively on 2026-10-19T19:06:10Z."@en ;
    dct:creator "Jeffrey Wallk" ;
    dct:contributor "Claude (AI assistant), at the direction of Jeffrey Wallk" ;
    prov:startedAtTime "2026-10-19T18:43:37Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    prov:endedAtTime "2026-10-19T18:43:37Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
